{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":856,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"817deeb6-b6b0-4137-85a2-9799362000ea","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":230929762,"PostDateInt":1786690931000,"PostDate":"2026-08-14T15:02:11","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"海外OTD(J17935)","OrgId":3735272,"Org":"海外销售部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["浙江省·杭州市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1. 审核并起草销售/采购合同，管理签署、归档及全生命周期，建立合同数据库。  \n2. 接收、审核、确认客户订单，录入系统并跟踪“接单-排产-发运”全流程，处理变更与异常。  \n3. 审核销售发票，管理应收账款与定金，跟踪付款进度，预警资金风险并完成订单对账。  \n4. 协调供应链、物流及关务，监控出厂到目的港运输，确保清关文件准确、时效达标并快速解决异常。  \n5. 持续优化“中单-交付”端到端流程，搭建运营数据看板，分析订单满足率、交付周期、库存周转等核心指标","Require":"1. 本科及以上学历，国际贸易、物流管理、供应链管理、商务管理等相关专业。\n2. 5年以上中后台运营管理经验，有汽车、大型机械设备、跨境电商或外贸行业经验者优先，熟悉整车进出口流程者尤佳。\n3. 精通国际贸易术语（Incoterms 2020），熟悉进出口业务、国际结算（如信用证、电汇）及主要贸易单证。\n4. 具备出色的流程管理能力、注重细节、严谨负责，能够同时处理多项任务并承受压力。\n5. 熟练Excel的数据处理能力。\n6. 优秀的中英文书面及口语沟通能力。","ClassificationOne":"销售类","ClassificationTwo":"杭州市","Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-08-14T15:02:11","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward"